    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0905_green_01",
      "hash": "31286df728b1b018",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "青绿：好！\\n由[VAR TRNAME(0000)]先来是吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0905_green_02",
      "hash": "312870f728b1b531",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "接招吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0905_dummy_02",
      "hash": "3ce78b6f47fb37f4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 6]"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0905_green_03",
      "hash": "31286ff728b1b37e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "青绿：谁先来都无所谓。"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main0905_green_04",
      "hash": "312872f728b1b897",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "青绿：很好～！\\n看来你已经准备好\\r\\n面对火箭队的挑战了！\\c\\n那么，\\n西尔佛公司就交给你了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main0905_red_03",
      "hash": "cf2dde7ee5ed07ce",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 9]"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main0905_sys_02",
      "hash": "b0a05f3c3ff2a7a3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 10]"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main0905_green_05",
      "hash": "312871f728b1b6e4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "好了！\\n接下来轮到[VAR TRNAME(0001)]了！\\c\\n继续继续！"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main0905_rival_01",
      "hash": "ab975143120cf9bd",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 12]"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main0905_rival_02",
      "hash": "ab974e43120cf4a4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]：呼……\\n光是看看都把我紧张坏了……\\c\\n青绿哥哥的宝可梦们\\n眼神都好有气势啊！\\c\\n我也要努力加油！\\n[VAR TRNAME(0000)]你就先走吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_main0905_stafff_01",
      "hash": "0dd0da442d90e603",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "前台：青绿以实力雄厚而出名……\\c\\n我觉得他应该\\n没有对你们手软哦。\\c\\n你们两个都好能干！\\n希望你们真的能拯救西尔佛……！"
    }
  ],
